  {
    "episode_id": 91985,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/1/91985.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 58,
    "turn_text": "This is Veterans Chronicles. I'm Greg Carumbas, honored to be joined today by Ohio Congressman Bill Johnson. For 26 years, he served in the United States Air Force, retiring with the rank of Lieutenant Colonel, probably the most significant military action during your active duty time was the Gulf War. And obviously much of that was an air campaign. How did your work influence how successful we were able to be in that",
