    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/1/91985.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 64,
    "turn_text": "Talk a little bit more about your time those last couple of years of your active duty at Special Forces Command. That's obviously quite a bit different than what you had been doing before then. What was that like? What were you focused on mainly",
