    "turn_text": "destroyed in one place, it just goes somewhere else and crops up somewhere else. We have to have a full on policy and strategic plan to go after this. You've got to go after them militarily, destroy them where they are, where they're sleeping, where they're working, where they're hiding. But you also have to go after their support structure. Where are they getting the funding from? One of the things, and this may sound a little bit odd, but that's why it is so vitally important that America attain energy independence. Where is this terrorist threat cropping up from? It's cropping up from a region of the world that we have poured billions and billions and billions of dollars into over the years buying our energy resources from those countries. We need to stop that. We've got the capability to be energy independent here at home and help our friends and allies across the globe. And if we cut off the funding source, That would go a long way.",
